      <guid>https://kiranchavala2.in/blog/enabling-zsh-history/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Add  alias in your .zshrc file&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;alias history=&amp;ldquo;history 0&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;source ~/.zshrc&lt;/p&gt;</description>
